\[
4\,\text{NH}_3 + 5\,\text{O}_2 \;\longrightarrow\; 4\,\text{NO} + 6\,\text{H}_2\text{O}
\]

All atoms are balanced (N:4, H:12, O:10).  

Final answer: \boxed{4\,\text{NH}_3 + 5\,\text{O}_2 \rightarrow 4\,\text{NO} + 6\,\text{H}_2\text{O}}

